&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the single threaded owner for all first and last mile activities in France, your mission is to drive quality and cost improvement for your market, which you will deliver on through strong supplier management, relentless focus on driving key metrics, influencing stakeholders and being an inspirational leader for your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own the day to day delivery operations for all of France and have a team of delivery managers and coordinators to support you in your mission. You will spend your time ensuring that our DSP’s are meeting service obligations whilst future proofing your operation so that we are able to support the ambitious growth plans for VintedGo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;ol1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reduce FM / LM cost per parcel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;The budget holder for your market, responsible for keeping costs under control and identifying / implementing savings through strategic negotiations or other efficiency opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Whilst the mission is to reduce cost, there must be a cognisance of the impact on speed and own any trade off’s that need to be made&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Responsible for improving customer experience by making sure that parcels as passing through each stage of the funnel without delay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Day to day driving of DSP performance through the delivery team. Ensure that team is focussed on the most impactful topics through data analysis and clear action planning to improve funnel speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Ensure that we are visiting the correct amount of points on a weekly basis and the split between the points is balanced to ensure parcels are not dwelling needlessly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Building strong relationships with key stakeholders to ensure that:&lt;br&gt;transportation topics are being prioritised, we are supporting the wider business where needed, we have clear handshakes between functions and we are taking decisions that provide the biggest net benefit to the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team motivation and happiness: &lt;/strong&gt;Ensure that the delivery team is clear on the departmental objectives and motivated to go above and beyond to achieve our goals. The team should feel supported and empowered to drive meaningful business improvement&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logistics and transportation expertise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen for P&amp;amp;L ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced problem solver within logistics and transportation businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical knowledges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record building and executing operational improvement plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of the subtleties and nuances in French transportation networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in French transport regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience working with French DSP’s providing last mile services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly numerate with strong data analysis skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Natural communication and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Ability to navigate into a multicultural environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days of holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily lunch allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Medical Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€85.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€95.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🦄 DataDome&lt;/strong&gt; delivers real-time bot and agent trust management, enabling businesses to trust the intent behind their traffic—human, bot, or AI agent. Named a Leader in The Forrester Wave™ for Bot And Agent Trust Management Q2 2026, DataDome is trusted by enterprises like Etsy, PayPal, and Soundcloud. Acting as a traffic control plane, DataDome&#39;s multi-layered AI engine leverages thousands of models and 5 trillion signals daily, analyzing the intent of every session so only trusted traffic reaches your business — powering growth across your sites, apps, APIs, and MCP servers. Backed by a 24/7 SOC and expert threat researchers, DataDome stops 20k+ attacks every second. With 35+ global PoPs, and 80+ ready-made integrations, DataDome is a recognized Leader on G2 across several categories—delivering traffic you can trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Dashboard technical stack is mainly composed of ElasticSearch &amp;amp; MariaDB for the storage, Symfony 8 &amp;amp; Angular 21. Our infrastructure is deployed on AWS, GCP and Azure, using Docker, Ansible and Terraform, and monitored with Grafana, Prometheus &amp;amp; DataDog. We&#39;re also heavily invested in integrating AI into our engineering workflows, and expect the same from anyone joining the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Dashboard team is currently composed of a mixture Fullstack, Backend &amp;amp; Frontend engineers, and is looking for a Frontend-strong engineer to help us design and develop our current product. Some of our best engineers started specialized and grew into full-stack over time — if that&#39;s a path you want, the team supports it, but there&#39;s no expectation to do so.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fully remote position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will be more specifically in charge of:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing new features in our customer dashboard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving the frontend performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finding and fixing bug reports from our Q/A process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating and fixing production bugs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning and evaluating the issues to work on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using AI tools as part of your day-to-day engineering workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning topics you want to push forward — from idea to delivery, with real autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaging directly with stakeholders to shape and defend your proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re the perfect candidate if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have been building applications for 4+ years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong, hands-on experience with Angular 17 or newer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable using AI-assisted tools to speed up and improve your engineering work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about code quality, simplicity and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your growth path:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you want to, you can grow into full-stack over time — picking up Symfony/PHP with support from the team, at your own pace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is entirely optional and up to you: staying and deepening your frontend expertise is just as valid a path here&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Whichever direction you choose becomes part of your ongoing career path conversations — and for the right person, motivated and driven, there&#39;s real room to grow further, whether that&#39;s deepening technical expertise or moving into a leadership role as the team scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with Symfony or another PHP framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve worked at high scale with systems like MariaDB, Redis or ElasticSearch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You wrote your own crawler once or twice before&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how internet works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a BS/MS/PhD in a scientific field or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flex Life:&lt;/strong&gt; While we offer remote, hybrid, &amp;amp; in-office options each position specifies the level of flexibility. Our Parisian office is located next to the Opera Garnier. You will also receive a 500€ stipend to help you set up your ideal workspace if you work hybrid or remotely.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are full remote, the SNCF dicount card is paid for you to come to our office to visit us &amp;amp; your team!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Health Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; We have partnered with Kenko for your healthcare needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 100€ annual allowance is provided for a leisure activity of your choice in Sports or Culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual allowance of €200 if you come to the office by bike to cover maintenance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Development&lt;/strong&gt;: #Weaimhigh is part of our DNA, therefore we have invested in an internal Learning and Development platform and offer the opportunity to request additional training and support via your manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Events &amp;amp; Team building: #We care and we have fun!&lt;/strong&gt; We organise ****Annual Company-Offsite, Events, Drinks, Winter Party, Lunch &amp;amp; Learns and much more are part of our Culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parent Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Gift &amp;amp; care packages for parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PTO:&lt;/strong&gt; Based on the country you are based from (e.g. 25 days in France).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the next steps?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Talent Acquisition Manager : first interview and cultural fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Engineering Manager : technical and cultural fit + Take-home technical challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Team: Presentation and review of your &quot;technical proposal&quot; with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Member of the leadership team - Discussion about DataDome vision and &quot;raison d&#39;être&quot;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Now you really met everyone! Welcome to DataDome :)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
